GAL22V10
SUMADOR4

NC   A0   B0   A1   B1   A2   B2   A3   B3   Cin  NC   GND
NC   NC   NC   Cout S3   C2   S2   C1   S1   C0   S0   VCC

; --- Sumador completo 0 ---
S0 = A0*/B0*/Cin + /A0*B0*/Cin + /A0*/B0*Cin + A0*B0*Cin
C0 = A0*B0 + A0*Cin + B0*Cin

; --- Sumador completo 1 ---
S1 = A1*/B1*/C0 + /A1*B1*/C0 + /A1*/B1*C0 + A1*B1*C0
C1 = A1*B1 + A1*C0 + B1*C0

; --- Sumador completo 2 ---
S2 = A2*/B2*/C1 + /A2*B2*/C1 + /A2*/B2*C1 + A2*B2*C1
C2 = A2*B2 + A2*C1 + B2*C1

; --- Sumador completo 3 ---
S3 = A3*/B3*/C2 + /A3*B3*/C2 + /A3*/B3*C2 + A3*B3*C2
Cout = A3*B3 + A3*C2 + B3*C2

DESCRIPTION

Sumador de 4 bits a partir de 4 sumadores completos (ESCOM - IPN).
Entradas: A0-A3, B0-B3, Cin (pines 2-10). Salidas: S0-S3, Cout.
C0, C1, C2 son los acarreos intermedios (realimentados dentro de la GAL).
